DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
43639::$$$message_0369_0000_0000$$$::"No mercy against girls, either![lr]::
43640::$$$message_0369_0000_0001$$$::You're just two weeks too early to challenge me at hanafuda, Sakura!"::
43641::$$$message_0369_0000_0002$$$::"So she'd beat us if she had two weeks' practice.[lr]::
43642::$$$message_0369_0000_0003$$$::...I'm worried about what's going to happen to Sakura now that she's back to normal."::
43643::$$$message_0369_0000_0004$$$::"...That had to be just a trick of the imagination.[lr]::
43644::$$$message_0369_0000_0005$$$::I was feeling timid, so she seemed a little cool to me, that's all..."::
43645::$$$message_0369_0000_0006$$$::"Owww... I lose, I admit it... I'm sorry for getting cocky!"::
43646::$$$message_0369_0000_0007$$$::"As long as you admit you were wrong.[lr]::
43647::$$$message_0369_0000_0008$$$::Learn from this and try to transform only once every four years. Because it scares me."::
43648::$$$message_0369_0000_0009$$$::"I'll be as careful as I can. I really shouldn't have transformed just because I was left alone and unable to cook for three days."::
43649::$$$message_0369_0000_0010$$$::"Ahh, I see. [l][hfsigh layer=1][say storage=HSTR3A_TIG_0060 _name=藤ねえ]So even that's enough to make you turn."::
43650::$$$message_0369_0001_0000$$$::"...By the way, I wonder when you'll get on a high again."::
43651::$$$message_0369_0001_0001$$$::"Um, I think it'll happen once I see the popularity poll results. It's very likely."::
43652::$$$message_0369_0002_0000$$$::"I don't know what I'll do if I lose, even to Rider."::
43653::$$$message_0369_0002_0001$$$::"Urgh. [wait canskip=0 time=500][l][hffacechg chara=藤ねえ face=うーん2 layer=1 time=200][say storage=HSTR3A_TIG_0100 _name=藤ねえ]W-well, I like you, Sakura. I totally feel a kinship to you, since we both don't get our way."::
43654::$$$message_0369_0002_0002$$$::"I dunno about declaring your intent to wipe out mankind with a big grin, though."::
43655::$$$message_0369_0002_0003$$$::"...(gulp)"::
43656::$$$message_0369_0002_0004$$$::"Oh, I wouldn't do that."::
43657::$$$message_0369_0003_0000$$$::[hffacechg2 chara=桜 face=喜 pos=upper time=200]"I'll just add a few more strange bad endings to the main story."::
43658::$$$message_0369_0003_0001$$$::"Anyway, now that we've lost, we should be getting home.[lr]::
43659::$$$message_0369_0003_0002$$$::Here you go, Illya. This star is yours now."[nolr][p]::
43660::$$$message_0369_0003_0003$$$::"Oh, our second one. No, our third counting my own."::
43661::$$$message_0369_0003_0004$$$::"Yes. It's too bad we lost, but I can cheer for the winner if it's you, Illya. I hope you collect all the stars and create a new route."::
43662::$$$message_0369_0003_0005$$$::"Don't need to tell me twice... But are you sure, Sakura? That all but guarantees you'll be the final boss."::
43663::$$$message_0369_0003_0006$$$::"Ahaha. I'm prepared for that."::
43664::$$$message_0369_0004_0000$$$::[hffacechg chara=桜 face=哀 pos=upper time=200]"But you had to sacrifice yourself for me before, so it's only right that I repay the favor."::
43665::$$$message_0369_0004_0001$$$::"Hmm... Fine, then.[lr]::
43666::$$$message_0369_0004_0002$$$::I'll accept your favor. Let's meet again in the main story if my wish comes true."::
43667::$$$message_0369_0004_0003$$$::"Of course. Be careful, you two."[nolr][p]::
43668::$$$message_0369_0004_0004$$$::"I think she's gone... Maybe we should take a break now. I'm pooped after two fights in a row."::
43669::$$$message_0369_0004_0005$$$::"Yeah. Why don't we head back to your house for now?"::
43670::$$$message_0369_0005_0000$$$::"I'm hungry, so we can take it easy for the rest of today and get ready for... [l][play storage=bgm22.ogg][hffacechg chara=ブルマイリヤ face=真剣 layer=1 time=200][hfchance layer=1][say storage=HSTR3A_BIR_0110 _name=ブルマイリヤ]Who's there!?"::
43671::$$$message_0369_0005_0001$$$::"...Heh heh heh heh. I'm impressed, Illya. You beat not just Shirou but even Sakura. But your cakewalk ends now."[wsplinemove canskip=0]::
43672::$$$message_0369_0005_0002$$$::"Say what!? Could that silhouette on the wall striking a silly pose that reminds me of a certain Goldy, possibly be...!?"[wm canskip=0]::
43673::$$$message_0369_0005_0003$$$::"That's right! The strongest team in style and substance, Rin Tohsaka and her Servant Archer, [wvs][hfchance layer=0][say storage=HSTR3A_RIN_0030 _name=凛]are on the scene!"[wm canskip=0]::
43674::$$$message_0369_0005_0004$$$::"Now the real fight begins, you two![lr]::
43675::$$$message_0369_0005_0005$$$::Time to learn your place!"[nolr][p]::��